# Trivy findings accepted for this deployment, with rationale.
#
# The service loads only baked local ONNX/tokenizer artifacts from trusted
# build inputs. It does not set trust_remote_code and does not save models from
# untrusted chat templates. The fixed releases are transformers 5.x, which
# optimum-onnx (required by sentence-transformers[onnx]) currently rejects by
# pinning transformers<4.58. Revisit when optimum-onnx supports transformers 5.
